# EXPRESS-005 manual requests.
# 1. Start the server: npm run dev:express:5  (starts with products p1 … p8)
# 2. Click "Send Request" above a request (VS Code extension "REST Client").

@host = http://localhost:3000

### All products (expect 200, p1 … p8)
GET {{host}}/products

### One category, any case (expect 200, p5 p6 p7 p8)
GET {{host}}/products?category=GEAR

### Only products in stock (expect 200, p1 p3 p4 p5 p7 p8)
GET {{host}}/products?inStock=true

### Both filters (expect 200, p5 p7 p8)
GET {{host}}/products?category=gear&inStock=true

### No matches (expect 200, empty data)
GET {{host}}/products?category=toys

### Invalid inStock (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/products?inStock=yes
